; A proposal file for the CLI's evidence-carrying upgrade gate.
; Ordinary lines are Agel source committed as one transaction on promotion.
; `;effect NAME` declares an effect the checker must find in the source.
; `;test EXPR => EXPECTED` runs in a fork of the zero-authority canary world.
; Run in the CLI after (def transform (fn (x) (+ x 1))):
;   :propose examples/upgrade-proposal.agel
;   :promote
;test (transform 9) => 10
;test (transform -1) => 0
;test (transform-all '(1 2 3)) => '(2 3 4)
(import agel/sequence)
(def transform (fn (x) (+ 1 x)))
(def transform-all (fn (values) (map transform values)))
